  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Grand Coven",
    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), select an unused option if desired. Its effect ends when you start your following [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). For **THOUSAND SONS** models, Imbued Manifestation increases Range by 6\" for ranged PSYCHIC weapons. Psychic Maelstrom improves Wound rolls by 1 for PSYCHIC weapon attacks. Wrath of the Immaterium gives **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** to PSYCHIC weapons. An option can be activated once a battle.",
